# mcbaratone

`mcbaratone` is a Python automation client and Fabric bridge for controlling
Minecraft through Baritone. The project goal is a bot that can start in a real
Survival world, reach and defeat the Ender Dragon, unlock post-End resources,
and then build and terraform without player input.

This is an active work in progress. Bridge communication, checkpointing, and
early-game automation exist; the complete no-cheat spawn-to-endgame run is not
yet proven. The read-only Survival acceptance suite defines what “working”
means at every milestone.

